    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "If we take GCN apart, which idea truly changed the direction of research?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "GCN provided a simple and effective layer for learning from graph structure and node features together. It became a standard baseline for semi-supervised node classification and graph representation learning.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-semi-supervised-classification-with-graph-convolutional-networks"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Node features are averaged through normalized graph neighborhoods and transformed into class predictions.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-semi-supervised-classification-with-graph-convolutional-networks"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Experts generally treat GCN as the model that made graph neural networks accessible to a broad machine-learning audience. Its long-term legacy is the normalized-neighbor aggregation layer used as a reference point for later graph models.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-semi-supervised-classification-with-graph-convolutional-networks"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Seen alongside Graph Neural Network, GCN reveals how the same technical question can echo across different eras.",
